o;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a>:</b> <b>Mithral</b> armor is one type lighter then normal. Arcane Spell Failure decreased by 10%. Maximum dexterity bonus increased by 2. Armor check penalty reduced by 3.</span></span> \n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\" rowspan=\"9\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Turbine_Shield.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Turbine_Shield.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"476\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0000102000</span>102<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">7.50 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><b><a href=\"/page/N/A\" title=\"N/A\">N/A</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mithral\" title=\"Mithral\">Mithral</a>:</b> <b>Mithral</b> armor is one type lighter then normal. Arcane Spell Failure decreased by 10%. Maximum dexterity bonus increased by 2. Armor check penalty reduced by 3.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;background:#CCEEFF\"><i>A large metal shield is strapped to your forearm and gripped with your hand.</i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<p>This is the shield given to <a href=\"/page/Turbine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Turbine\">Turbine</a> employees for use on their +Admin characters. This shield can sometimes be seen worn by in-game GMs along with various DDO team members during live events (either on the live servers or the <a href=\"/page/Lamannia\" title=\"Lamannia\">Lamannia</a> preview server.) This shield has not been distributed on the live servers to non-Admin characters, although there have been times that players on Lamannia have found themselves in possession of one of these shields.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817063748\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.126 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2884/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20662/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3710/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n127.04%  138.716     32 Template:IO\n100.00%  109.188      1 -total\n 90.96%   99.321      1 Template:Named_item\n 88.11%   96.201      1 Template:Named_Shield\n 45.54%   49.722      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 44.65%   48.747      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 42.57%   46.480      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 40.24%   43.942      2 Template:InCategory\n 19.45%   21.235      2 Template:Mat\n 17.38%   18.972      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:23207-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817063748 and revision id 635628. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
